      "body": "Superior Finlease Limited announced private placement issue and allotment up to 1,564,159 equity shares of face value of INR 1 at an isuse price of INR 5 for gross proceeds of INR 7,820,795 on February 13, 2026. The transaction includes participation from Ravi Kant Sharma for 313,385 shares at post issue shareholding of 0.70%, Puspa Kumari for 100,000 shares at a post issue shareholding of 0.22% and includes other individual investors.  The transaction is approved by board of directors of the company and is subject to shareholders’ approval by way of passing of the Special Resolution in the Extra-Ordinary General Meeting to be held on March 18, 2026 and other necessary approvals (including applicable statutory and regulatory approvals) and is subject to In-Principal Approval from Stock Exc",
